{"id":2719,"date":"2026-06-11T14:11:37","date_gmt":"2026-06-11T14:11:37","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/stonesandtiles.in\/?post_type=product&#038;p=2719"},"modified":"2026-10-02T10:22:37","modified_gmt":"2026-10-02T10:22:37","slug":"kota-stone-green-satin","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/stonesandtiles.in\/product\/kota-stone-green-satin\/","title":{"rendered":"Kota Stone Green Satin"},"content":{"rendered":"<p data-start=\"293\" data-end=\"605\">Kota Green Satin is a premium natural limestone admired for its distinctive green shades and refined satin finish. The smooth surface enhances the stone&#8217;s natural beauty while maintaining its authentic character, creating a sophisticated appearance suitable for both modern and traditional architectural designs.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"607\" data-end=\"951\">Widely preferred by architects, builders, designers, and homeowners, Kota Green Satin offers exceptional versatility across a variety of residential and commercial applications. Whether used for flooring, wall cladding, pathways, courtyards, terraces, or landscape features, it adds elegance, durability, and timeless appeal to any environment.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"953\" data-end=\"1236\">Known for its strength, low maintenance requirements, and long-lasting performance, the stone performs exceptionally well in both interior and exterior spaces. Its subtle natural variations ensure every installation possesses a unique appearance while maintaining visual consistency.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1238\" data-end=\"1433\">Combining natural beauty, durability, and functionality, Kota Green Satin remains a preferred choice for projects seeking a premium natural stone solution with lasting value and aesthetic appeal.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4zmfa9\" data-start=\"1435\" data-end=\"1456\">Product Attributes<\/h2>\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<table class=\"w-f